{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25252","headline":"酬致政杨祭酒见寄 · 李逢吉","name":"酬致政杨祭酒见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"初还相印罢戎旃，获守皇居在紫烟。\n妄比酇侯功蔑尔，每怀疏傅意悠然。\n应将半俸沾闾里，料入中条访洞天。\n十载别离那可道，倍令惊喜见来篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李逢吉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25252.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25252","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}